% =============================================================================
% eigenius_precursors.bib
%
% Philosophical, methodological, and historical precursors of the Eigenius
% approach to applying formal reasoning to science and engineering.
%
% These references are not used internally by the system (see eigenius.bib for
% those, and eigenius_additional.bib for things the system relies on but does
% not currently cite). Instead, they situate Eigenius within a longer arc of
% work on:
%
%   1. Mathematical Knowledge Management (MKM)
%   2. Existence proofs that verified knowledge can scale
%   3. Suppes-style structuralism in the philosophy of science
%   4. Formal ontologies as a proof-of-concept for adoption in science
%   5. The reproducibility / open-workflow movement
%   6. The closest contemporary parallel project (the Underlay)
%   7. The direct ancestor (Pharos, Microsoft Health Solutions Group)
%
% Citation keys are lowercase and topic-suffixed for stability.
% =============================================================================


