% 3. Suppes-style structuralism — philosophical precursors of institutions
%    The view that scientific theories are families of structures (models)
%    closed under appropriate morphisms, which is essentially the institutional
%    framing Eigenius adopts for layers and theories.
% -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

